"FsAgent.example\n  Returns an instance of the FsAgent.\n    {\n  \"_scanner\": {\n    \"_rootPath\": \"<PROJECT_ROOT>\",\n    \"_tree\": null,\n    \"_watcher\": null,\n    \"_changeCallbacks\": [],\n    \"_options\": {\n      \"ignore\": [\n        \".sync-errors.log\",\n        \".fsagent-tmp-\",\n        \".fsagent-state.json\"\n      ],\n      \"followSymlinks\": false,\n      \"bs\": {\n        \"blobs\": {}\n      }\n    },\n    \"_bs\": {\n      \"blobs\": {}\n    },\n    \"_paused\": false,\n    \"_missedChangesDuringPause\": false,\n    \"_safetyTimer\": null,\n    \"_pausedAt\": null,\n    \"_autoResumeTimer\": null,\n    \"_stopRequested\": false,\n    \"_blobCache\": {},\n    \"_nextBlobCache\": {},\n    \"_cacheLoaded\": false,\n    \"_vanishedDuringScan\": 0,\n    \"_activeScan\": null,\n    \"_pendingScan\": null\n  },\n  \"_adapter\": {\n    \"_bs\": {\n      \"blobs\": {}\n    }\n  },\n  \"_rootPath\": \"<PROJECT_ROOT>\",\n  \"_bs\": {\n    \"blobs\": {}\n  },\n  \"_lastRefusalAnswerMs\": 0,\n  \"_remoteApplyInFlight\": false,\n  \"_rescanDeferred\": false,\n  \"_restoreWritten\": 0,\n  \"_restoreSkipped\": 0,\n  \"_pendingDeletes\": {},\n  \"_stateHistory\": [],\n  \"_announcedFiles\": {},\n  \"_restorePruned\": 0,\n  \"_restoreLocked\": [],\n  \"_restoreUnavailable\": [],\n  \"_restoredBlobs\": {},\n  \"_timeouts\": {\n    \"dbQuery\": 10000,\n    \"fetchTree\": 20000,\n    \"extract\": 15000,\n    \"restore\": 15000,\n    \"syncCallback\": 25000,\n    \"debounceMs\": 300,\n    \"processRefRetries\": 3,\n    \"processRefRetryDelayMs\": 5000,\n    \"fastFirstRetryDelayMs\": 250,\n    \"recoveryRetries\": 10\n  },\n  \"_resolveConflicts\": false\n}\n\nFsScanner - Scan file system\n  Scans a directory and extracts RLJSON tree structure\n    Scanned 15 tree nodes\n    Root hash: eYykoCxOl4sq-BUAW-1Mk5\n  Root tree:\n    ID: .\n    Is Parent: true\n    Children: 8\n  Sample trees:\n    📄 client-server-setup.ts [aLiqJEP8...]\n    📄 example-from-client.ts [8e4B7bqQ...]\n    📄 live-client-server-socketio.ts [gMV46hB-...]\n    📄 live-client-server.ts [KRmjUzAN...]\n    📄 README.md [pXPCldFv...]\n\nFsScanner - Watch for changes\n  Register a callback to be notified of file system changes\n    Scanner is ready. Changes will be logged.\n    (Call scanner.watch() to start watching)\n\nFsAgent - Manual Database Sync\n  Manually sync filesystem changes to database using Connector\n    Use syncToDb() with a Connector for socket-based synchronization:\n    \n    import { Connector } from \"@rljson/db\";\n    import { Route } from \"@rljson/rljson\";\n    import { SocketMock } from \"@rljson/io\";\n    \n    const agent = new FsAgent(\n      \"./my-project\",\n      myBlobStorage,\n      { ignore: [\"node_modules\", \".git\"] }\n    );\n    \n    const socket = new SocketMock();\n    const route = Route.fromFlat(\"/projectTree+\");\n    const connector = new Connector(db, route, socket);\n    \n    const stopSync = await agent.syncToDb(db, connector, \"projectTree\");\n    \n    // Agent now:\n    // 1. Watches for file changes\n    // 2. Extracts trees and stores blobs\n    // 3. Broadcasts changes via Connector\n    \n    // Stop syncing:\n    stopSync();\n    agent.dispose();"